  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rCbrnHi.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fire-arrows-start-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/461166?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffire-arrows-ignite-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/fire-arrows-ignite-fire?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>使用這個模組，著火的箭矢落在方塊上會引發火災。這讓遊戲玩法更加有趣且真實。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgiZ8EZ.gif\" width=\"508\" height=\"508\"></p><p><strong>配置設定：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲中配置此模組，或編輯個人資料夾中的JSON檔案 <code>config/firearrows.json</code>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocksBrokenByFireArrows</strong> - 可被火取代的方塊列表，例如空氣</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
